                                "sense_id": "fdcce6d7-a841-3623-bf8c-a565d2a7bb65",
                                "text": "'Tis certain, therefore, that in all our notions of morals vve never entertain ſuch an abſurdity as that of paſſive obedience, but make allovvances for reſiſtance in the more flagrant inſtances of tyranny and oppreſſion."
